Author: Stephen Chilcote <toastengineer@gmail.com>
Date:   Sat Jul 25 01:04:44 2026 -0500

    adversary: weakest-present caller, shrieker mark state-machine, warden engulf
    
    Anti-sprint defense pass (director 2026-07-25), all via existing systems:
    
    - Weakest defender present in a chamber (no portal open, no ally calling)
      peels off to call reinforcements (_weakest_should_call).
    - Shrieker rebuilt as a self-contained state machine: SENTINEL -> WARNING
      (shriek + emit distress, run home, rouse the group) -> APPROACHING_TO_MARK
      (climb distress) -> MARKING (3x dash off the firing line, lock, fire a real
      MARKER projectile that leads its target) -> RALLYING (spread the alarm) ->
      stand down to SENTINEL patrol. Old alert-carrying behaviours preserved.
    - The MARK (glob) is a Brand object: on marker contact it renews; while held it
      lays the existing follow-me army-ant trail on each crossed doorway and makes
      scent pour, decaying on its own. Rendered as a glob stuck to the player with a
      trail emitting from it.
    - Warden ENGULF (EngulfGrip): charge (flash) -> lunge at 2.5x -> a head-on hit
      drags the player into its core for 75/s until the warden is killed.
    - Adversary reclaims undefended planted pods (STATION_HP).
    - Legible caller/mark/engulf/pod-torn render cues.
    
    621 tests pass. Reckless bot still clears (tuning of coverage/callers ongoing).
    
    Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>

