+class Brand:
+    """The intruder's MARK. A shrieker's marker projectile calls renew() on
+    contact; decay() lowers strength each tick, so an unrenewed mark fades.
+    While strength > 0, _alarm_tick amplifies the intruder's scent, bleeds it
